# migrations/ IS NOT EXCLUDED, deliberately. The nightly backup job reads
# migrations/000_baseline.sql and refuses to write a schema-less backup, so
# without this folder the image cannot back his record up. It was excluded
# here until 2026-09-12, which is why the build for #81 failed at step 0 with
# "stat migrations/: file does not exist" while the same code passed on a
# developer's disk, where the folder is simply present.
#
# It is REMOVED from this file rather than re-included with a negation,
# because directory negation in .dockerignore is unreliable. The whole folder
# is 118 KB; the image does not notice it.


